sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler
    participant App as Rosca App
    participant Worker as Queue/Worker
    participant MPesa as MPesa Provider

    Scheduler->>App: run rosca:close-rounds
    App->>App: select winner (lockForUpdate)
    App->>Worker: dispatch ProcessPayoutJob(payout)
    Worker->>MPesa: call B2C paymentrequest (async)
    MPesa-->>App: POST /api/rosca/mpesa/callback (ConversationID, ResultCode)
    App->>App: finalize payout (processed/failed), ledger
    App->>AKA: create Akaunting journal / ledger
